{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-03_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-03","title":"同時走失","storyCode":"6-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-03_end.txt","sourceHash":"23916efc2fead66ea7572555bdacc222989efd8d3dfc433018deadbdcbad4991","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"灰喉遭遇了浮士德，箭弩拔張之間，灰喉的單純卻讓浮士德若有所思。\n他最終沒有下殺手，只是讓灰喉離開。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"有多少人死在你面前了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯語）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"我會的。我會帶回去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......（烏薩斯語）......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我不去切爾諾伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡很安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"睡吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有多少人死在我面前了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"放下武器！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......只有你一個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"別回頭。再動一下，我就射擊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"弩手要先射擊，再說話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？身體......消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"不......情報檔案上有，你是他們的指揮官之一，浮士德。你的法術瞞不住我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我知道你的法術只對視覺起作用。只要我射擊，你也一樣會被弩箭刺穿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你能預判我的動作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"我們，兩個落單的弩手。同時按下扳機，我們都死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"代號灰喉。你什麼時候跳到我身後的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你第三次眨眼的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......你很爽快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你也和你的小隊失散了。我不想殺傷沒有戰意的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島想要救助感染者。我看到你在幫助感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是我的戰友。你是我的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島怎麼會有這樣幼稚的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我很幼稚。我只會按命令做事。當我自己做決定時，我什麼都做不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你要當心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"手指鬆開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你的弩沒有連射機能。只要我躲過你的第一發射擊，你就會死。別去按扳機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"只聽從命令，一味依賴別人的想法行動，最後會變成可怕的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"多數人只是盲從，他們會退縮，也會顫抖。他們並不真依賴誰，他們只是沒有開始思考。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......而那些沒有自己方向的人，只是種索求願望來獲得成就感和存在感的機器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"啟動，不斷運作，投入願望，實現願望，把周圍一切都吃掉，把許願的人也吃掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你經歷的還不夠多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我看見你和剛才那個感染者最後的對話。你在做對的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你的對錯和我無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德，你一直在避開近衛局，哪怕是落單的龍門近衛局，你也沒有射擊他們。這些我都看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......別把我的忍耐當成軟弱。如果伏擊的人是我，你已經死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"但你沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你很累了。只要是用弩的人，都能看出你的疲勞。弦繃得太緊，這樣下去一定會斷掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......作為弩手，你實在太多話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你也遭遇了那些特殊感染者，我們可以想辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的也許很對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"但我沒有辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"（在開始運動的一瞬間消失了？......沒法判斷他的位置！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不殺我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有射擊我，我也沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"下次不會了。如果你沒射殺我，我就會射殺你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有惡意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"那才最可憐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許你需要別人回答你的問題。不回答，你就不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"別有負擔，殺人、被殺，這種事天天發生。你們羅德島也不可能避過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼不能一起幫助他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"——我很想答應你的要求，但我知道不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"別再追蹤我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你和他們的接觸太少了，大腦裡滿是錯覺和誤解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......而我已經，沒有任何辦法了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有多少人因為我做了什麼而死，又有多少人因為我什麼都沒做而死？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["？？？","灰喉"]}]}
